#
# Applies to the v0.1.41 tree that 0003 (lat=) and 0004 (latt=/latspan=) are already in.
#
# Engine keys:
#   latt=23,29,35,41,-1        as in 0004: the layers whose residual to read
#   latspans=A-B,C-D,..        up to 16 spans, absolute prompt positions, in the caller's order
#   latpool=last,mean          per span per layer: its last row and its mean (2 rows) instead of all rows
# The file becomes STRLAT3 when spans are used: 5 int64 per segment {kind, layer, span, pos0, rows}.
#   kind 3 = a raw tap block (0004), 4 = a span's last row, 5 = a span's mean row, 6 = a span's raw rows.
